+is `checks/f7c6c7bbc781/learnability.json`: ten labels cover the original four
+pairs under both rules plus a distinct proposed replacement demonstration under
+both rules. The original visible lesson, both complete programs and both query
+predictions remain in that private evidence for possible alternative-answer
+research; no official answer or public export was changed.
+
+**Proposed repair, not applied:** replace one small-ring demonstration with a
+distinguishing four-ring demonstration, or add a lesson-level gate requiring
+such a demonstration whenever a query has four or more rings. The retained
+replacement is seed `2`, sample index `4`, with exact dimensions `8×8`; replacing
+demo index `2` with it keeps three demonstrations and refutes this rival without
+reusing the query. Retain lawful small-ring examples rather than narrowing the
+generator's whole domain.
+
+This is one explicit assembled lesson and one tested rival, not an estimate of
+production-lesson ambiguity frequency or proof of unique interpretation. No
+canonical generator, authority, approval or lesson assembly was modified.
